WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.081 --> 00:00:09.240
Beauty glared at the beast.

2
00:00:09.241 --> 00:00:11.857
"What did you do to Father?"

3
00:00:11.858 --> 00:00:15.362
"I did what I promised," Beast said.

4
00:00:15.363 --> 00:00:18.266
"I sent him home."

5
00:00:18.267 --> 00:00:22.265
"I don't believe you," Beauty said.

6
00:00:22.266 --> 00:00:27.542
Beast grumbled. "I don't lie."

7
00:00:27.543 --> 00:00:32.023
Clang! The cell door swung open.

8
00:00:32.024 --> 00:00:35.368
"Follow me," Beast said.

9
00:00:35.369 --> 00:00:38.330
Beauty didn't move.

10
00:00:38.331 --> 00:00:43.081
"I said, follow me!" Beast yelled.

11
00:00:43.082 --> 00:00:46.929
Beauty thought about running away.

12
00:00:46.930 --> 00:00:50.796
But Beast was so big and fierce.

13
00:00:50.797 --> 00:00:56.044
"I'd better do what he says," she thought.

14
00:00:56.045 --> 00:01:00.788
Beauty followed Beast out of the dungeon.

15
00:01:00.789 --> 00:01:05.410
They climbed long, winding stairs.

16
00:01:05.411 --> 00:01:09.969
Suddenly they were inside a grand castle.

17
00:01:09.970 --> 00:01:13.763
Beauty saw gold and crystal.

18
00:01:13.764 --> 00:01:17.798
There were beautiful statues and paintings.

19
00:01:17.799 --> 00:01:22.309
A bird flew about, dusting everything.

20
00:01:22.310 --> 00:01:25.806
"Oh!" Beauty thought in surprise.

21
00:01:25.807 --> 00:01:28.731
"This castle is magic too!"

22
00:01:28.732 --> 00:01:33.203
And yet, the hall was so cold, her teeth chattered.

23
00:01:33.204 --> 00:01:36.103
"P-please let me go home."

24
00:01:36.104 --> 00:01:48.446
"No!" the beast shouted. "A promise is a promise!"

25
00:01:48.447 --> 00:01:54.715
He stopped in front of a large mirror.

26
00:01:54.716 --> 00:01:59.126
"Why are you showing me this?" Beauty asked.

27
00:01:59.127 --> 00:02:02.303
"I don't care what I look like."

28
00:02:02.304 --> 00:02:05.631
"Just look!" Beast snapped.

29
00:02:05.632 --> 00:02:09.603
His ring was glowing again.

30
00:02:09.604 --> 00:02:13.141
Beauty stared into the mirror.

31
00:02:13.142 --> 00:02:17.306
Slowly an image appeared in it.

32
00:02:17.307 --> 00:02:21.767
She gasped. "Father!"

33
00:02:21.768 --> 00:02:26.032
She saw Father safe at home.

34
00:02:26.033 --> 00:02:29.655
The cupboard was full of food.

35
00:02:29.656 --> 00:02:35.267
The hearth was full of firewood.

36
00:02:35.268 --> 00:02:43.764
"See?" Beast said. "He's fine."

37
00:02:43.765 --> 00:02:48.664
Beast walked Beauty to a room.

38
00:02:48.665 --> 00:02:52.573
"This is your room.

39
00:02:52.574 --> 00:02:57.069
There are dresses in the closet.

40
00:02:57.070 --> 00:03:03.791
Change your clothes, then come to dinner."

41
00:03:03.792 --> 00:03:07.378
"Dinner?" Beauty said.

42
00:03:07.379 --> 00:03:13.112
Beast nodded. "That is part of your punishment.

43
00:03:13.113 --> 00:03:16.798
You must eat with me every night."

44
00:03:16.799 --> 00:03:23.802
Beauty shrugged. "That doesn't sound too terrible."

45
00:03:23.803 --> 00:03:28.966
To her surprise, Beast laughed. "Ha!

46
00:03:28.967 --> 00:03:39.914
We'll see what you think later!"

